flowchart TD
  T[Tab enters board] --> A[Focus active cell]
  A --> K{Keyboard input}
  K -- Arrow keys --> H[Move one row or column]
  K -- Home / End --> R[First or last cell in row]
  K -- Ctrl Home / Ctrl End --> B[First or last board cell]
  K -- Enter / Space --> M[Activate focused cell]
  H --> A
  R --> A
  B --> A
  M --> C[Validate and resolve move]
